    "Or enter it in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller indtast den i Indstillinger."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oder in den Einstellungen eingeben."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O introducirla en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tai syötä se Asetuksissa."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller skriv den inn i Innstillinger."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Of voer hem in bij Instellingen."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller ange den i Inställningar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or enter where it points": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller indtast, hvor den peger"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oder eingeben, wohin es zeigt"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O introducir hacia dónde apunta"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tai syötä, mihin se osoittaa"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller skriv inn hvor den peker"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Of voer in waar hij naartoe wijst"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eller ange vart det pekar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orbital elements and the satellite catalogue (launch, orbit, radar cross-section) come from CelesTrak. Physical dimensions come from Jonathan McDowell's General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radio transmitters come from the SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep sky objects come from OpenNGC by Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, star names from the IAU Working Group on Star Names, and comet orbits from the IAU Minor Planet Center.": {
      "comment": "Keep the names of people, organisations, catalogues, websites and licences as they are: CelesTrak, General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects, SatNOGS DB, OpenNGC, IAU, CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0.",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baneelementer og satellitkataloget (opsendelse, bane, radartværsnit) kommer fra CelesTrak. Fysiske dimensioner kommer fra Jonathan McDowells General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat) under CC BY 4.0. Radiosendere kommer fra SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org) under CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep sky-objekter kommer fra OpenNGC af Mattia Verga under CC BY-SA 4.0, stjernenavne fra IAU Working Group on Star Names og kometbaner fra IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bahnelemente und der Satellitenkatalog (Start, Bahn, Radarquerschnitt) stammen von CelesTrak. Physische Abmessungen stammen aus Jonathan McDowells General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat) unter CC BY 4.0. Funksender stammen aus der SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org) unter CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep-Sky-Objekte stammen aus OpenNGC von Mattia Verga unter CC BY-SA 4.0, Sternnamen von der IAU Working Group on Star Names und Kometenbahnen vom IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orbital elements and the satellite catalog (launch, orbit, radar cross-section) come from CelesTrak. Physical dimensions come from Jonathan McDowell's General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radio transmitters come from the SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep sky objects come from OpenNGC by Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, star names from the IAU Working Group on Star Names, and comet orbits from the IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orbital elements and the satellite catalogue (launch, orbit, radar cross-section) come from CelesTrak. Physical dimensions come from Jonathan McDowell's General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radio transmitters come from the SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep sky objects come from OpenNGC by Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, star names from the IAU Working Group on Star Names, and comet orbits from the IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los elementos orbitales y el catálogo de satélites (lanzamiento, órbita, sección eficaz de radar) proceden de CelesTrak. Las dimensiones físicas proceden del General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects de Jonathan McDowell (planet4589.org/space/gcat), bajo CC BY 4.0. Los transmisores de radio proceden de la SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), bajo CC BY-SA 4.0. Los objetos de cielo profundo proceden de OpenNGC de Mattia Verga, bajo CC BY-SA 4.0; los nombres de estrellas, del IAU Working Group on Star Names, y las órbitas de cometas, del IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rataelementit ja satelliittiluettelo (laukaisu, rata, tutkapoikkipinta-ala) ovat CelesTrakista. Fyysiset mitat ovat Jonathan McDowellin General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects -luettelosta (planet4589.org/space/gcat), lisenssillä CC BY 4.0. Radiolähettimet ovat SatNOGS DB:stä (db.satnogs.org), lisenssillä CC BY-SA 4.0. Syvän taivaan kohteet ovat Mattia Vergan OpenNGC:stä, lisenssillä CC BY-SA 4.0, tähtien nimet IAU Working Group on Star Namesilta ja komeettojen radat IAU Minor Planet Centeristä."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baneelementer og satellittkatalogen (oppskyting, bane, radartverrsnitt) kommer fra CelesTrak. Fysiske mål kommer fra Jonathan McDowells General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radiosendere kommer fra SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Dypromsobjekter kommer fra OpenNGC av Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, stjernenavn fra IAU Working Group on Star Names, og kometbaner fra IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baanelementen en de satellietcatalogus (lancering, baan, radardoorsnede) komen van CelesTrak. Fysieke afmetingen komen uit de General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects van Jonathan McDowell (planet4589.org/space/gcat), onder CC BY 4.0. Radiozenders komen uit de SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), onder CC BY-SA 4.0. Deep-sky-objecten komen uit OpenNGC van Mattia Verga, onder CC BY-SA 4.0, sternamen van de IAU Working Group on Star Names en komeetbanen van het IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Banelement och satellitkatalogen (uppskjutning, bana, radarmålyta) kommer från CelesTrak. Fysiska mått kommer från Jonathan McDowells General Catalog of Artificial Space Objects (planet4589.org/space/gcat), under CC BY 4.0. Radiosändare kommer från SatNOGS DB (db.satnogs.org), under CC BY-SA 4.0. Djuprymdsobjekt kommer från OpenNGC av Mattia Verga, under CC BY-SA 4.0, stjärnnamn från IAU Working Group on Star Names och kometbanor från IAU Minor Planet Center."
          }
        }
      }
    },
